WEBVTT

00:21.170 --> 00:23.420
Wh-what the hell was that...?

00:31.210 --> 00:33.130
Wh-who are you...?

00:33.130 --> 00:36.580
I came to see the famous Hero
and his party for myself.

00:36.580 --> 00:39.080
Instead, I found a trio of hopeless halfwits.

00:40.380 --> 00:42.420
Your magic is incredible!

00:42.420 --> 00:44.040
Maybe even stronger than Fred's.

00:44.500 --> 00:45.790
Thanks for saving us back th-

00:45.790 --> 00:48.250
I'LL be the one slaying the Demon Lord.

00:48.580 --> 00:52.710
You three oughtta hurry on home to mommy
so she can change your diapers.

01:20.000 --> 01:21.380
You again?!

01:27.380 --> 01:28.960
Wha-? Hey!

01:47.920 --> 01:49.500
Thanks for the help, Yuria.

02:03.250 --> 02:05.500
Hey, come sit by the fire.

02:05.500 --> 02:07.000
Aren't you cold?

02:08.880 --> 02:13.000
Y'know, I get that they're demons,
but most of 'em are wimps.

02:13.000 --> 02:14.830
Feels like it's not even worth the effort.

02:14.830 --> 02:16.330
You said it.

02:16.330 --> 02:19.670
We'll be the ones saving your ass
next time, Yuria.

02:21.830 --> 02:23.500
Not exactly friendly, is she?

02:23.500 --> 02:25.420
That's the pot calling the kettle black.

02:25.420 --> 02:26.210
Huh?

02:26.210 --> 02:27.920
I thought I told you to go home.

02:28.330 --> 02:31.630
Most of the demons are wimps?
You aren't paying attention.

02:32.460 --> 02:34.630
They're getting stronger by the minute.

02:35.130 --> 02:39.630
If it weren't for me, the three of you
would be long dead by now.

02:40.960 --> 02:43.210
This is your last warning.

02:43.210 --> 02:46.540
Be good little boys and go home
first thing in the morning.

02:48.250 --> 02:50.040
C'mon, Yuria.

02:50.040 --> 02:52.210
There's no need to be so uptight.

02:52.210 --> 02:54.920
We've been friends for
a while now, haven't we?

02:56.130 --> 02:58.210
I don't need friends...

03:03.630 --> 03:05.920
Why's she so angry at us?

03:05.920 --> 03:07.670
Just drop it.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.420
Interesting.

03:59.420 --> 04:02.460
What a shame it would be
to leave you in the Human Realm.

04:02.960 --> 04:06.290
Why not be reborn as
one of us demons instead?

04:07.170 --> 04:08.750
Don't make me laugh.

04:08.750 --> 04:11.580
I intend to slay the Demon Lord myself.

04:12.710 --> 04:16.080
And I'm the only one capable of doing it.

04:45.920 --> 04:48.580
If you refuse to cooperate...

04:48.580 --> 04:52.330
then I could always force your corpse
to obey me instead.

04:55.380 --> 04:56.500
Yuria!

04:59.790 --> 05:02.170
Waiting for a woman to be alone?

05:02.170 --> 05:03.750
You're a special kind of coward!

05:03.750 --> 05:06.170
This bastard looks pretty tough.

05:06.170 --> 05:07.710
Guess we don't have to hold back.

06:41.330 --> 06:43.920
<b>#10 Leo vs. Fred</b>

06:52.540 --> 06:55.750
You know your strength is
no match for mine, Fred!

07:01.380 --> 07:02.580
He got him...!

07:03.130 --> 07:04.540
Chief Secretary!

07:24.210 --> 07:25.920
Brings back memories...

07:25.920 --> 07:30.330
That healing spell of yours saved my life
more times than I can count.

07:31.210 --> 07:33.290
But it's a risky way to fight.

07:34.040 --> 07:36.000
Why'd you come alone?

07:36.000 --> 07:39.920
I was sure you'd bring
Max and Yuria along with you...

07:41.460 --> 07:43.460
What are they, immortal?

07:43.710 --> 07:45.630
Looks like they're saying something...

07:45.630 --> 07:47.130
Is the mic picking it up?

07:47.130 --> 07:50.380
Somebody needs to teach
these guys how to project...

07:50.630 --> 07:52.500
I didn't think someone as sensible as you

07:52.500 --> 07:56.380
would be foolish enough to try
and fight me at close range.

07:56.580 --> 08:01.630
I figured you had a plan,
but it seems you really are all alone.

08:02.330 --> 08:04.290
You come here to die, Fred?

08:09.000 --> 08:11.210
Awfully presumptious, aren't we?

08:12.000 --> 08:13.210
Hm?

08:17.580 --> 08:21.210
While you were playing king with
your little suck-up flunkies,

08:21.210 --> 08:24.130
you must've forgotten to keep up
with your training.

08:24.130 --> 08:26.420
I've never claimed to be a king.

08:27.040 --> 08:29.960
I know I'm not cut out for
something like that!

08:29.960 --> 08:31.630
OBVIOUSLY!

08:31.630 --> 08:34.380
You call ME foolish?! That's MY line!

08:34.380 --> 08:36.290
YOU'RE the one acting like an idiot!

08:36.290 --> 08:38.330
"The Gamma Republic"?!

08:38.330 --> 08:40.130
IT'S TOTAL HORSESHIT!

08:40.130 --> 08:43.420
No, no. I'm well aware of
how crazy it seems...

08:44.750 --> 08:45.920
STILL...!

08:46.670 --> 08:50.420
When they banished me to a wasteland
that stood untouched for centuries,

08:50.420 --> 08:53.040
people believed in me enough to follow me!

08:53.710 --> 08:55.790
Friends who went to bat for me!

08:56.130 --> 08:59.750
They left the Kingdom alongside me
and transformed this land...

08:59.750 --> 09:04.330
They worked their asses off to dig up
the magic ore deposits and the hot springs...

09:04.710 --> 09:09.630
And the Kingdom tried to steal EVERYTHING
from us, without so much as a thank-you!

09:10.210 --> 09:12.000
What about their livelihoods?!

09:12.000 --> 09:13.630
What about their feelings?!

09:13.920 --> 09:17.670
You're right...
It was totally unwarranted...

09:24.330 --> 09:26.330
But you're not the first person in the world

09:26.330 --> 09:29.290
whose hard work has gone
completely unrecognized.

09:29.630 --> 09:32.920
You should've accepted the hand
you were dealt like everyone else.

09:32.920 --> 09:35.500
You AND your pathetic little lackeys!

09:42.040 --> 09:44.250
Do you really believe killing me

09:44.250 --> 09:48.250
is going to convince the Kingdom
to recognize your independence?!

09:48.460 --> 09:52.000
This pointless war of yours
is NEVER going to end!

09:52.000 --> 09:54.670
Yes, it will! I'll finish it myself!

09:54.670 --> 09:58.460
Our voices WILL be heard!
That includes the Kingdom!

09:58.460 --> 10:00.670
They HAVE to listen to us eventually!

10:00.670 --> 10:02.500
Oh, of course they will!

10:02.500 --> 10:05.000
Go ahead and see what happens
when you're persistent!

10:05.330 --> 10:07.330
Surely they'll see your perspective!

10:07.330 --> 10:10.250
Surely they'd be willing to find
an amicable solution!

10:10.670 --> 10:15.170
I bet they would... if the whole world
was made up of overly optimistic,

10:15.170 --> 10:18.330
STUPIDLY HONEST BASTARDS LIKE YOU!

10:21.420 --> 10:24.830
<b>The Kingdom Invades the Gamma Republic! Happening LIVE!!</b>

10:23.790 --> 10:26.040
Same old Leo and Fred...

10:26.040 --> 10:29.250
They're both just about as strong
as you'd expect after ten years.

10:29.750 --> 10:31.630
It's an intense battle...

10:34.880 --> 10:37.710
At this rate, their bodies are
bound to give out soon...

10:41.500 --> 10:42.920
Aren't you gonna watch?

10:43.880 --> 10:45.380
Not interested.

10:45.380 --> 10:47.920
Stop it! This isn't the time for your sulking!

10:47.920 --> 10:50.000
Those are your companions...

10:50.000 --> 10:51.960
They're going to kill each other!

10:51.960 --> 10:55.000
Are you really going to sit there
and feign indifference?!

10:58.750 --> 11:01.330
You're just going to let your friends
march to their deaths?!

11:01.330 --> 11:03.040
ANSWER ME, HERO!

11:09.170 --> 11:10.920
Shut up.

11:13.630 --> 11:15.580
What would you have me do?!

11:15.580 --> 11:18.330
What would me going out there accomplish?!

11:18.330 --> 11:20.920
Whose side am I supposed to take?!

11:20.920 --> 11:22.130
Huh?!

11:22.130 --> 11:23.710
Leo or Fred?!

11:23.710 --> 11:26.710
Who would you have me kill?! WELL?!

11:26.710 --> 11:29.670
ARE YOU GOING TO MAKE ME CHOOSE?!

11:45.130 --> 11:47.960
Fine, then. It's a real shame, Max.

11:48.420 --> 11:50.920
But if that's how you feel,
then do what you want.

11:52.080 --> 11:54.580
I don't know who you are anymore.

12:02.000 --> 12:03.580
This is goodbye.

12:35.500 --> 12:37.920
That's exactly what I mean
by "stupidly honest."

12:41.080 --> 12:42.790
You'll pay for that...

13:21.130 --> 13:22.880
Who in the hell...?

13:23.540 --> 13:24.790
Wh-what was that...?

13:24.790 --> 13:26.250
What just happened...?!

13:26.420 --> 13:28.290
Owie...

13:29.040 --> 13:31.460
Oh! Camera, camera...

13:32.080 --> 13:33.630
There it is!

13:39.380 --> 13:42.880
I've waited ages for this moment,
you foolish mortals!

13:42.880 --> 13:44.420
What is that thing...?

13:44.420 --> 13:46.330
That certainly came out of left field...

13:46.330 --> 13:48.710
I travelled here to look upon
your silly little faces

13:48.710 --> 13:51.040
as you went about your silly little lives...

13:51.040 --> 13:55.420
So imagine my surprise when I found you
bickering amongst yourselves!

13:55.420 --> 13:57.960
Oh, this is just too good!

13:58.210 --> 13:59.960
Now then, humans...

13:59.960 --> 14:01.920
You'd do well to remember your fear!

14:01.920 --> 14:04.420
Because I'm here to declare...

14:04.420 --> 14:07.920
that the Demon Lord has returned
in all his glory!

14:11.960 --> 14:13.630
It's kinda cute.

14:18.630 --> 14:19.880
Seriously...?!

14:19.880 --> 14:21.710
The hell is he thinking?!

14:21.830 --> 14:24.210
Wha-? Who let the brat in here?!

14:24.210 --> 14:26.540
Did she just say something
about the Demon Lord...?

14:26.540 --> 14:28.960
I don't care! Get her out of the way!

14:28.960 --> 14:30.670
From down here? How...?

14:30.670 --> 14:32.630
DON'T TOUCH THE DRONE!

14:32.630 --> 14:34.380
That demon...

14:34.380 --> 14:35.880
You know it?

14:35.880 --> 14:38.630
It's the demon that was with Max
when I saw him recently.

14:38.630 --> 14:40.080
Wait, what...?!

14:40.080 --> 14:44.420
I knew Max had been hanging
around demons lately, but...

14:44.420 --> 14:46.540
I've never seen that one before.

14:47.040 --> 14:48.830
What's it trying to do...?

14:49.420 --> 14:50.500
The Demon Lord...?

14:50.750 --> 14:53.210
First, I'd like to celebrate my resurrection!

14:53.210 --> 14:57.290
And I'll do it by ripping the Hero's
two companions down there to shreds!

14:57.290 --> 15:00.830
You don't stand a chance against me
in your injured state!

15:03.790 --> 15:07.330
Now perish in darkness, Leo and Fred!

15:07.330 --> 15:09.210
Huh? For real?

15:09.210 --> 15:11.580
N-no way...
This can't be happening!

15:11.830 --> 15:14.170
TAKE THIS!

15:23.330 --> 15:25.080
Well, that was annoying.

15:25.080 --> 15:26.080
Yeah.

15:32.210 --> 15:33.710
You're kidding me...

15:38.880 --> 15:40.920
Whaddya think, Fred?

15:40.920 --> 15:43.960
It's an uncanny resemblance...
Y'think it's really him?

15:43.960 --> 15:49.000
The Hero isn't here, and you two can't set
your differences aside for five seconds...

15:49.000 --> 15:50.630
You're mere insects to me!

15:51.170 --> 15:54.460
Max the Hero!
Are you watching closely?!

15:54.460 --> 15:56.290
What are you waiting for?!

15:56.920 --> 15:58.750
If you don't get out here now,

15:58.750 --> 16:01.630
I'll make sure you lose
EVERYTHING this time!

16:01.630 --> 16:05.210
If there's any part of you
that doesn't want your friends to die...

16:05.210 --> 16:08.790
GET OFF YOUR LAZY ASS AND FACE ME!

16:08.790 --> 16:13.290
RISE TO THE CHALLENGE ONCE MORE, MAX!

16:26.080 --> 16:29.540
I've got more questions for Max
than I did before...

16:29.540 --> 16:33.250
Then I think we ought to finish this
once and for all.

16:33.250 --> 16:35.670
Before we get interrupted again.

16:41.960 --> 16:44.670
Goddammit...

16:44.670 --> 16:48.040
Screw every last one of them...

16:52.080 --> 16:53.330
Fuck it!

16:53.330 --> 16:55.040
I don't care what happens!

16:55.040 --> 16:56.580
I don't give a rat's ass!

16:56.580 --> 17:01.920
'Cause now you've PISSED ME OFF!

17:05.630 --> 17:07.040
Uh... Testing, testing.

17:07.040 --> 17:08.750
Hello, livestream viewers.

17:08.750 --> 17:10.670
Can you believe what we're seeing right now?

17:10.670 --> 17:14.790
An intense battle between Fred and Leo
has begun to unfold before our very eyes!

17:14.790 --> 17:16.420
There's no doubt about it:

17:16.420 --> 17:21.040
The outcome of this fight will determine
the fate of the Kingdom and the Republic!

17:21.500 --> 17:24.420
It's physical strength versus
magical prowess!

17:24.420 --> 17:27.250
Who will be the ultimate victor?!

17:27.250 --> 17:29.130
The chat says to shut up.

17:45.170 --> 17:46.750
Yeah!

17:46.750 --> 17:49.580
LET'S GOOOOO-!

18:06.500 --> 18:08.830
The chain must've come off...

18:09.210 --> 18:11.500
Can't catch a break, I swear...

18:12.000 --> 18:14.210
God, what a pain in the ass...

18:14.210 --> 18:15.790
Now my hands are all dirty...

18:15.790 --> 18:18.290
I am THIS close to just going back inside...

18:21.880 --> 18:23.880
And up we go...

18:24.580 --> 18:25.880
Now then...

18:33.380 --> 18:34.710
Huh...?!

18:34.710 --> 18:36.380
Wh-what is THAT?!

18:36.380 --> 18:38.880
MOVE IT!

18:43.380 --> 18:46.630
Tsk, a one-lane road and traffic for miles...

18:46.630 --> 18:49.080
Oh yeah. "Share the road," my ass!

18:49.080 --> 18:51.710
If ya want cyclists ridin' in the street,

18:51.710 --> 18:53.960
then give 'em the frickin'
infrastructure to do it!

19:04.380 --> 19:05.830
What the...?!

19:25.000 --> 19:29.460
Well, Leo? Are you prepared
to meet your maker? Hm?

19:29.460 --> 19:31.630
Yeah, I am...

19:31.630 --> 19:35.420
But something tells me
you're prepared for the same thing.

19:42.500 --> 19:44.750
Chief Secretary, please...

19:44.750 --> 19:46.580
Don't do this...

19:49.040 --> 19:50.420
What's that?

19:58.040 --> 20:02.380
OUTTA THE WAY!

20:10.880 --> 20:13.210
ROT IN HELL, LEO!

20:13.210 --> 20:15.210
BRING IT ON, FRED!

22:18.210 --> 22:21.710
Well, what do you know?
I'm all out of ammo.

22:23.710 --> 22:25.170
He's got nowhere to go!

22:25.170 --> 22:26.580
Give it up already!

22:28.380 --> 22:31.500
Think you can fight me while injured?

22:34.420 --> 22:37.130
You're not fooling anyone!
Just accept the fact that you-

22:47.580 --> 22:51.420
I'll be looking forward to
the next time we meet.

22:52.040 --> 22:55.040
Dammit, I guess he escaped...

23:03.170 --> 23:04.920
Are you alright, Yuria?

23:05.330 --> 23:07.540
Glad you made it out alive.

23:07.540 --> 23:09.500
Why did you save me?

23:09.500 --> 23:12.670
You're a valuable asset
who shares a common goal.

23:12.670 --> 23:15.130
We'd be stupid to let that go to waste.

23:15.960 --> 23:18.670
Y'know what we call that
in layman's terms?

23:18.670 --> 23:20.580
It's called "having friends."

23:37.920 --> 23:39.920
Come on, let's get moving!
